@host = http://localhost:8080

### 입금 (204)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}/deposits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 2000
}

### 출금 (204)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 500
}

### 이체 (홍길동 -> 김철수) (수수료 적용) (204)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountNumber": "123456789012",
  "toAccountNumber": "999999999999",
  "amount": 10000
}

### 이체 (김철수 -> 홍길동) (수수료 적용) (204)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountNumber": "999999999999",
  "toAccountNumber": "123456789012",
  "amount": 5000
}

### 출금 한도 초과 (400)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1000001
}
